Package: storyline
Title: Reading Orders for MONSTRUM
Version: 0.3.1
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: random
Authors@R: person("Petr", "Tureček", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "petr.turecek@natur.cuni.cz")
Author: Petr Tureček [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Petr Tureček <petr.turecek@natur.cuni.cz>
Description: Provides chronological, kairological, and randomized chapter
    contents for the fiction book MONSTRUM: Stručná zpráva o stavu příběhu
    v roce 52 000 ± 200 let. Optional chapter labels and openings can be
    printed and written as UTF-8 tab-separated text.
